{title: Good Christian Men, Rejoice}
{artist: Latin carol · tr. John Mason Neale}
{key: F}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 96}

Verse 1
[F]Good Christian men, rejoice with [Bb]heart and [C]soul and [F]voice!
Give ye heed to [Bb]what we [C]say: [Dm]Jesus [C]Christ is [F]born today.
[F]Ox and ass before him [Bb]bow, and [C]he is [Dm]in the [C]manger now:
[F]Christ is [C]born to[Dm]day, [F]Christ is [C]born to[F]day!
